:start
Hello. Pick a number.
> One.
	[enter: number | #1]
> Two.
	[enter: number | #2]
> Three.
	[enter: number | #3]
[goto: exit]

:number(#1)
Just one? Boo!!!
[back]

:number($n) [$n % #2] -> odds
You chose #n, an odd number!
[back]

:number($n) -> evens
You chose #n, an even number!
[mention: even]
[back]

:exit [mentioned: even]
See you!
[exit]

:exit
Bye!
[exit]

:note(person1, person2)
This is a note when selecting person1 and person2!
[back]

:note(person1) [mentioned: even] -> even_person
This is just about person 1.
[back]

:note(person2)
This is for person2!
[back]

:note(_)
This is for any notes!
[back]

:add(_, #2)
Adding something to 2!
[back]